#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/news/1291507200.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.8pre2 released"
msgstr "Sortie de Xfce 4.8pre2"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1291507200.md:7
msgid ""
"We are pleased to announce the second preview release of Xfce 4.8. This "
"release marks the beginning of the string freeze. From today on until the "
"final release, strings may no longer be changed in the master branch of Xfce"
" core components. This will help translators to prepare their translations "
"for the final release scheduled on January 16th, 2011."
msgstr ""
"Nous sommes heureux d’annoncer la deuxième préversion de Xfce 4.8. Cette "
"publication marque le début du gel des chaînes qui, jusqu’à la version "
"finale, ne peuvent plus être modifiées dans les composants de base de la "
"version en développement de Xfce. Ceci aidera les traducteurs à être prêts "
"pour la sortie de la version finale prévue le 16 janvier 2011."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1291507200.md:11
msgid ""
"For this release we focused on fixing bugs in all Xfce components. We "
"managed to close a great number of them thanks to all the persons who "
"reported them and tested proposed fixes quickly."
msgstr ""
"Pour cette version, nous nous sommes concentrés sur les corrections de "
"bogues des composants Xfce. Nous avons réussi à en éliminer de nombreux "
"grâce aux personnes les ayant signalés et ayant testé les correctifs "
"rapidement."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1291507200.md:13
msgid ""
"A few minor panel features were added despite feature freeze. We also "
"managed to work on two long time requests: proper support for editing the "
"application menu with menu editors (Alacarte being the one that we tested) "
"and integration with the Compiz viewport. Of course, this release also "
"features a lot of new and improved translations thanks to the amazing work "
"of our translation teams."
msgstr ""
"Quelques fonctionnalités mineures ont été ajoutées au tableau de bord malgré"
" le gel des fonctionnalités. Nous avons également pu travailler sur deux "
"demandes de longue date : une prise en charge correcte de l’édition du menu "
"des applications avec des éditeurs de menu (Alacarte étant celui que nous "
"avons testé) et l’intégration avec le viewport de Compiz. Bien entendu, "
"cette version comprend également de nombreuses traductions nouvelles et "
"améliorées grâce au travail remarquable de nos équipes de traduction."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1291507200.md:15
msgid "[Download](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.8pre2/)"
msgstr "[Télécharger](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.8pre2/)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1291507200.md:16
msgid "[Changes in this release](/download/changelogs/4.8pre2)"
msgstr "[Nouveautés de cette version](/download/changelogs/4.8pre2)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1291507200.md:17
msgid "[Permalink](/about/news/1291507200/)"
msgstr "[Lien permanent](/about/news/1291507200/)"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/news/1293926400.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.8pre3 released"
msgstr "Sortie de Xfce 4.8pre3"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1293926400.md:7
msgid ""
"Today we are pleased to announce the third and hopefully final preview "
"release of Xfce 4.8 which is set to be pushed out to the public on January "
"16th, 2011. Compared to Xfce 4.8pre2 this release mostly features "
"translation updates and bug fixes."
msgstr ""
"Nous avons le plaisir de vous annoncer aujourd’hui la troisième et, "
"espérons-le, dernière préversion de Xfce 4.8 dont la sortie officielle est "
"prévue le 16 janvier 2011. Par rapport à Xfce 4.8pre2, elle a surtout "
"bénéficié de mises à jour de traductions et de corrections de bogues."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1293926400.md:11
msgid ""
"With christmas and new year's eve between 4.8pre2 and 4.8pre3 it comes as no"
" surprise that for most components only a few issues were tackled."
msgstr ""
"Avec Noël et le Nouvel An tombant entre la 4.8pre2 et la 4.8pre3, il n’est "
"pas surprenant que seuls certains problèmes aient été traités."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1293926400.md:13
msgid ""
"Among other things we updated the default keyboard shortcuts to include "
"monitor keys. The status icon of the file manager's progress dialog is now "
"properly hidden when the dialog is destroyed. Its wallpaper plugin is now "
"capable of handling filenames with spaces. The environment variables of "
"commands launched from the Xfce run dialog were not set properly, so we "
"fixed that so that commands launched from the dialog always inherit the "
"environment of the Xfce session."
msgstr ""
"Parmi d’autres choses, nous avons actualisé les raccourcis clavier par "
"défaut pour y inclure les touches moniteur. L’icône d’état de la fenêtre de "
"progression du gestionnaire de fichiers est dorénavant correctement masquée "
"lorsque celle-ci est fermée. Le greffon de fond d’écran est désormais "
"capable de gérer les noms de fichiers contenant des espaces. Les variables "
"d’environnement de commandes lancées depuis la fenêtre d’exécution de Xfce "
"n’étaient pas correctement définies, nous avons donc fait en sorte qu’elles "
"héritent toujours de l’environnement de la session Xfce."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1293926400.md:15
msgid ""
"We also made the `--reboot` and `--halt` parameters of xfce4-session-logout "
"work again which previously simply logged out the active user. In order to "
"avoid a race condition at session startup and in order to speed things up a "
"little more we no longer use xrdb to update xft and cursor settings and "
"instead, update the related XSETTINGS properties ourselves."
msgstr ""
"Nous avons également refait fonctionner les paramètres `--reboot` et "
"`--halt` de xfce4-session-logout, qui auparavant déconnectaient simplement "
"l’utilisateur actif. Afin d’éviter une condition de concurrence au démarrage"
" de la session et afin d’accélérer un peu les choses, nous n’utilisons plus "
"xrdb pour mettre à jour les paramètres xft et de curseur, et mettons plutôt "
"à jour nous-mêmes les propriétés XSETTINGS correspondantes."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1293926400.md:17
msgid ""
"In the window manager xfwm4, we aligned the time period required for a "
"double click with that of normal applications. Via the hidden option "
"/general/mousewheel_rollup one can now disable windows being rolled up via "
"the mouse wheel. The window manager now also properly handles resolution "
"changes in fullscreen windows like those appearing in games. Xfwm4's "
"application switcher now only appears once in cloned mode."
msgstr ""
"Dans le gestionnaire de fenêtres xfwm4, nous avons aligné l’intervalle de "
"temps minimum pour un double-clic sur celui des applications normales. Il "
"est possible de désactiver l’enroulement des fenêtres par la molette de la "
"souris avec l’option cachée /general/mousewheel_rollup. Le gestionnaire de "
"fenêtres gère désormais correctement les changements de résolution dans les "
"fenêtres en plein écran, comme celles apparaissant dans les jeux. Le "
"sélecteur d’application de Xfwm4 n’apparaît maintenant qu’une seule fois en "
"mode clone."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1293926400.md:19
msgid ""
"This may sound like a few useful fixes but it's nothing compared to the "
"amount of work that went into the new Xfce panel once again. Around 20+ "
"known bugs and regressions were fixed. Here is a short excerpt of the "
"complete changelog: Translation domains were fixed for external plugins, "
"plugins can be reordered with DND again, double-clicking items in the item "
"editor shows their preferences, dragging items to the item editor dialog "
"removes them from the panel again, tasklist windows can now be filtered by "
"monitor. Another issue that appeared recently and has now been fixed is the "
"icon sizing in the notification area, also known as the systray."
msgstr ""
"Ceci peut paraître peu, mais n’est rien à côté du travail conséquent fourni "
"une fois de plus pour le nouveau tableau de bord. Plus d’une vingtaine de "
"bogues et régressions ont été rectifiés. Voici un extrait du journal des "
"modifications : les domaines de traduction ont été amendés pour les greffons"
" externes ; les greffons peuvent de nouveau être réarrangés par glisser-"
"déposer ; double-cliquer sur un élément de l’éditeur d’éléments affichera "
"ses préférences ; faire glisser des éléments dans la fenêtre de l’éditeur "
"d’éléments les retirera du tableau de bord de nouveau ; les fenêtres de "
"liste de tâches peuvent maintenant être filtrées par écran. Le problème de "
"dimensionnement des icônes dans la zone de notification (systray) apparu "
"récemment a été corrigé."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1293926400.md:21
msgid ""
"Xfce 4.8pre3 also features a lot of translation updates, as can be seen in "
"the complete changelog."
msgstr ""
"Xfce 4.8pre3 bénéficie également de nombreuses améliorations de traduction, "
"comme vous pouvez le voir dans le journal des modifications."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1293926400.md:23
msgid ""
"Since we're following the Xfce [release model](/about/releasemodel) for 4.8,"
" we'd normally announce code freeze and the creation of early lifecycle "
"support branches today. We decided against this because there are not enough"
" people active to take care of all this at the moment. So we will continue "
"fixing bugs in master branches as we did between 4.8pre2 and 4.8pre3."
msgstr ""
"Comme nous suivons le [modèle de publication](/about/releasemodel) de Xfce "
"pour la 4.8, nous annoncerions normalement aujourd’hui le gel du code et la "
"création des branches de support en début de cycle de vie. Nous avons décidé"
" de ne pas le faire, car il n’y a pas assez de personnes actives pour "
"s’occuper de tout cela pour le moment. Nous continuerons donc à corriger les"
" bugs dans les branches master, comme nous l’avons fait entre 4.8pre2 et "
"4.8pre3."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1293926400.md:25
msgid "[Download](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.8pre3/)"
msgstr "[Télécharger](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.8pre3/)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1293926400.md:26
msgid "[Changes in this release](/download/changelogs/4.8pre3)"
msgstr "[Nouveautés de cette version](/download/changelogs/4.8pre3)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1293926400.md:27
msgid "[Permalink](/about/news/1293926400/)"
msgstr "[Lien permanent](/about/news/1293926400/)"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/news/1295136000.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.8 released"
msgstr "Sortie de Xfce 4.8"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1295136000.md:7
msgid ""
"Today, after almost two years of work, we have the special pleasure of "
"announcing the much awaited release of Xfce 4.8, the new stable version that"
" supersedes Xfce 4.6."
msgstr ""
"Aujourd’hui, après presque deux ans de travail, nous sommes particulièrement"
" heureux de vous annoncer la publication de Xfce 4.8, la nouvelle version "
"stable qui remplace la 4.6."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1295136000.md:11
msgid ""
"We hope that everyone will enjoy this release as much as we do. Sadly, this "
"will not be the case as the folks using any of the BSD systems will notice a"
" sudden loss of features. We think that this announcement is a good "
"opportunity to express our disagreement with the recent \"Linux-only\" "
"developments in the open source ecosystem, especially with regards to the "
"utilities we need in desktop environments."
msgstr ""
"Nous aimerions que tout le monde l’apprécie autant que nous. "
"Malheureusement, ce ne sera pas le cas pour les utilisateurs de systèmes BSD"
" qui constateront une perte de fonctionnalités. Nous profitons de cette "
"annonce pour exprimer notre désaccord avec les récentes évolutions de "
"l’écosystème du logiciel libre de se concentrer exclusivement sur Linux, "
"notamment en ce qui concerne les services dont nous avons besoin dans les "
"environnements de bureau."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1295136000.md:13
msgid ""
"Xfce 4.8 is our attempt to update the Xfce code base to all the new desktop "
"frameworks that were introduced in the past few years. We hope that our "
"efforts to drop pieces like ThunarVFS and HAL with GIO, udev, ConsoleKit and"
" PolicyKit will help bringing the Xfce desktop to modern distributions."
msgstr ""
"Avec Xfce 4.8, nous avons essayé d’adapter la base du code Xfce aux nouveaux"
" environnements de développement apparus ces dernières années. Nous espérons"
" que nos efforts d’abandonner des composants comme ThunarVFS et HAL avec "
"GIO, udev, ConsoleKit et PolicyKit aideront Xfce à trouver sa place au sein "
"des distributions modernes."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1295136000.md:15
msgid ""
"With Xfce 4.8 our users will be able to browse remote shares using a variety"
" of protocols (SFTP, SMB, FTP and many more). The window clutter has been "
"reduced by merging all file progress dialogs into a single one."
msgstr ""
"Cette version permettra aux utilisateurs d’accéder aux partages distants au "
"moyen de différents protocoles (SFTP, SMB, FTP et d’autres). L’encombrement "
"de l’écran a été réduit en fusionnant les fenêtres de progression des "
"fichiers. "

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1295136000.md:17
msgid ""
"Our panel application has been rewritten, thereby improving positioning, "
"transparency, item and launcher management. It also introduces a new menu "
"plugin to view directories. Its plugin framework remains compatible with 4.6"
" plugins."
msgstr ""
"Notre tableau de bord a été réécrit, améliorant le positionnement, la "
"transparence, la gestion des éléments et du lanceur. Il introduit également "
"un nouveau greffon de visualisation des répertoires. Son environnement de "
"développement de greffons reste compatible avec ceux de la 4.6."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1295136000.md:19
msgid ""
"We also improved our settings dialogs. The display configuration dialog now "
"supports RandR 1.2, detects screens automatically and allows our users to "
"pick their favorite resolution, refresh rate, rotation. Screens can be "
"configured to either work in clone mode or be placed next to each other. "
"Keyboard selection has become easier and more user-friendly. Also, the "
"manual settings editor has been updated to be more functional."
msgstr ""
"Nous avons également amélioré le gestionnaire de paramètres. La fenêtre de "
"configuration de l’affichage prend désormais en charge RandR 1.2, détecte "
"automatiquement les écrans et permet d’en changer la résolution, le taux de "
"rafraîchissement et l’orientation. Les écrans peuvent être configurés pour "
"travailler en mode clone ou juxtaposé. Choisir le clavier est plus simple et"
" plus agréable. En outre, l’éditeur de configurations manuel a été mis à "
"jour pour être plus fonctionnel."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1295136000.md:21
msgid ""
"Aside from the features implemented in Xfce, the 4.8 development cycle "
"brought us a bunch of other goodies. For the first time we had a serious "
"release strategy formed after the \"Xfce Release and Development Model\" "
"developed at the Ubuntu Desktop Summit in May 2009. A new web application "
"made release management a lot easier. We worked hard on improving the "
"situation of Xfce translators which led us to setting up our own Transifex "
"server. Something else you will hopefully notice is that our server and "
"mirroring infrastructure has been improved so that our servers hopefully "
"will not suddenly surrender shortly after this release announcement."
msgstr ""
"En plus des fonctionnalités intégrées à Xfce, le cycle de développement de "
"la 4.8 a apporté d’autres innovations. Pour la première fois, nous avons eu "
"une vraie stratégie de publication définie à partir du « modèle de "
"publication et de développement de Xfce » élaboré pendant la conférence des "
"bureaux Ubuntu de mai 2009. Une nouvelle application Web a rendu la gestion "
"des versions plus simple. Nous avons travaillé dur pour améliorer la "
"situation des traducteurs Xfce, ce qui nous a conduits à mettre en place "
"notre propre serveur Transifex. Nous espérons aussi que vous remarquerez "
"l’amélioration de l’infrastructure de notre serveur et ses miroirs, et "
"qu’elle tiendra le coup suite à l’annonce de cette version."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1295136000.md:23
msgid ""
"There is a lot more to discover and we hope a lot of you will give Xfce 4.8 "
"a try! There is a brief tour online on"
msgstr ""
"Il y a encore beaucoup à découvrir et nous espérons que bon nombre d’entre "
"vous essaieront Xfce 4.8 ! Voici une brève présentation en ligne : "

#: content/about/news/1295136000.md:25
msgid "<https://xfce.org/about/tour48>"
msgstr "<https://xfce.org/about/tour48>"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1295136000.md:27
msgid ""
"A summary of the changes since the 4.8pre3 preview release is available on "
"the following URL (it also includes links to the changes introduced in all "
"preview releases):"
msgstr ""
"Un résumé des changements intervenus depuis la préversion 4.8pre3 est "
"disponible à l’adresse suivante (il comprend aussi les liens vers les "
"changements des autres versions préliminaires) : "

#: content/about/news/1295136000.md:29
msgid "<https://xfce.org/download/changelogs/4.8>"
msgstr "<https://xfce.org/download/changelogs/4.8>"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1295136000.md:31
msgid ""
"The release can be downloaded either as individual releases or as a fat "
"tarball including all these individual versions:"
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez télécharger individuellement les paquets de cette version ou "
"sous la forme d’un fichier d’archive les contenant tous."

#: content/about/news/1295136000.md:33
msgid "<http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.8/>"
msgstr "<http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.8/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1295136000.md:35
msgid ""
"2011 has just begun and we are already planning for the future. The 4.10 "
"schedule will be worked on soon and hopefully, we will be able to turn Xfce "
"into a non-profit organization at this year's FOSDEM, so stay tuned!"
msgstr ""
"2011 vient de commencer et nous planifions déjà l’avenir. Nous travaillerons"
" bientôt sur le calendrier de la 4.10 et, nous l’espérons, nous pourrons "
"transformer Xfce en organisation à but non lucratif lors du FOSDEM de cette "
"année. Restez à l’écoute !"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1295136000.md:37
msgid ""
"But until then we hope you will enjoy today's release and join us in "
"celebrating. Thanks go out to all our contributors, bug reporters as well as"
" the awesome efforts of our translators and packagers."
msgstr ""
"Mais d’ici là, nous espérons que vous apprécierez la version publiée "
"aujourd’hui et que vous vous joindrez à nous pour célébrer. Nos "
"remerciements vont à tous nos contributeurs, aux personnes qui signalent les"
" bugs, ainsi qu’aux efforts remarquables de nos traducteurs et de nos "
"empaqueteurs."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1295136000.md:39 content/about/news/1335571200.md:33
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:66 content/about/news/1565568000.md:60
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:48 content/about/news/1671062400.md:29
#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:29
msgid "Best regards,<br />The Xfce development team"
msgstr "Cordialement, <br />L’équipe de développement Xfce"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/news/1333238400.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.10pre1 released"
msgstr "Sortie de Xfce 4.10pre1"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1333238400.md:7
msgid ""
"The Xfce development team is proud to announce the first preview release for"
" Xfce 4.10. Together with this preview release, the Xfce project announces "
"the feature freeze for the final 4.10 release which is set to be pushed out "
"to the world on April 28th, 2012."
msgstr ""
"L’équipe de développement est fière d’annoncer la sortie de la première "
"préversion de Xfce 4.10. L’intégration de nouvelles fonctionnalités est "
"désormais gelée d’ici la sortie de la version finale de la 4.10 prévue le 28"
" avril 2012."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1333238400.md:11
msgid ""
"This release incorporates major changes to the core of the Xfce desktop "
"environment and hopefully succeeds in fulfilling a number of long time "
"requests. Among the most notable updates is the new application finder that "
"merges the functionality of the old appfinder and xfrun4. The Panel also has"
" a new vertical mode [aka Deskbar] for better space usage on wide-screen "
"monitors and a new actions plugin. On the settings side the settings helper "
"is integrated in xfsettingsd, saving 1 running process. There is also a "
"reworked settings dialog with categories and pluggable dialogs enabled by "
"default. Basic Synaptics and Wacom settings in the Mouse settings and a new "
"MIME-Type editor. Thunar gained a more polished layout to reduce space usage"
" and more responsive interaction with the thumbnail generator. Because we "
"have not decided on how to merge the desktop functionality into Thunar yet, "
"Xfdesktop has instead received various improvements, including single-click "
"support, desktop icon thumbnails and better pasting of files. The Session "
"Manager has improved power management code, tips have been removed and "
"cleanup sessions from the interface. Last but not least, the Window Manager "
"now has support for tiling windows and arrow key navigation in the task "
"switcher."
msgstr ""
"Cette version apporte des changements majeurs au cœur de l’environnement de "
"bureau Xfce et, nous l’espérons, répond à certains souhaits de longue date. "
"Parmi les innovations majeures, notez l’apparition d’un nouveau chercheur "
"d’application qui combine les fonctionnalités de l’ancien appfinder et de "
"xfrun4. Le tableau de bord dispose d’un nouveau mode d’affichage vertical "
"(mode barre de bureau) pour une meilleure utilisation des écrans larges, "
"ainsi que d’un nouveau greffon d’actions. L’assistant de réglages est "
"dorénavant intégré à xfsettingsd, économisant ainsi l’exécution d’un "
"processus. L’agencement du gestionnaire de paramètres a été revu par "
"catégories et l’ajout de nouveaux éditeurs de paramètres autorisé par "
"défaut. Une prise en charge basique de Synaptics et Wacom a été intégrée "
"dans les paramètres de la souris. Un nouvel éditeur de type MIME a fait son "
"apparition. Thunar a été amélioré afin de réduire l’espace utilisé et d’être"
" plus réactif avec le générateur de miniatures. Étant donné que nous n’avons"
" pas encore décidé de la manière d’intégrer les fonctionnalités du bureau à "
"Thunar, Xfdesktop a reçu diverses améliorations, incluant la gestion du "
"simple clic, des miniatures et le perfectionnement de la copie des fichiers."
" Le gestionnaire de sessions gère mieux l’alimentation, les astuces ont été "
"retirées de l’interface et celle-ci a été épurée. Pour finir, le "
"gestionnaire de fenêtres gère désormais l’affichage en mosaïque et les "
"touches de navigation dans la fenêtre tabulation (Alt + Tab)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1333238400.md:13
msgid ""
"Another big change for users is the removal of user documentation of the "
"packages and introduction of [docs.xfce.org](https://docs.xfce.org). The "
"reason for this change is the limited contribution of documentation since "
"Xfce 4.8, so we hope the wiki will attract more contributors. The help "
"buttons in the interface still work, but you'll be asked to open the "
"documentation website in your web browser."
msgstr ""
"Un autre changement majeur pour les utilisateurs est la suppression de la "
"documentation utilisateur des paquets et l’introduction de "
"[docs.xfce.org](https://docs.xfce.org). La raison de ce changement est la "
"contribution limitée à la documentation depuis Xfce 4.8, nous espérons donc "
"que le wiki attirera davantage de contributeurs. Les boutons d’aide de "
"l’interface fonctionnent toujours, mais il vous sera demandé d’ouvrir le "
"site de documentation dans votre navigateur web."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1333238400.md:15
msgid ""
"Furthermore we dropped xfce-utils. Its content has either been removed or "
"moved to other Xfce packages. All other dependency changes are listed in the"
" 4.10pre1 ChangeLog. The Xfce core also gained a couple of new components "
"because we think they are critical for a minimal desktop: xfce4-power-"
"manager (power management), tumbler (thumbnail generation for Thunar and "
"other components), garcon (menu library, was already a dependency in 4.8), "
"thunar-volman (volume manager for Thunar)."
msgstr ""
"De plus, nous avons supprimé xfce-utils. Son contenu a été soit supprimé, "
"soit déplacé vers d’autres paquets Xfce. Toutes les autres modifications de "
"dépendances sont répertoriées dans le ChangeLog de la 4.10pre1. Le cœur de "
"Xfce a également gagné quelques nouveaux composants, car nous les "
"considérons comme essentiels pour un bureau minimal : xfce4-power-manager "
"(gestion de l’alimentation), tumbler (génération de vignettes pour Thunar et"
" d’autres composants), garcon (bibliothèque de menus, déjà une dépendance en"
" 4.8), thunar-volman (gestionnaire de volumes pour Thunar)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1333238400.md:17
msgid ""
"Of course translations also improved a lot, thanks to the amazing work of "
"our translation teams."
msgstr ""
"Bien entendu, les traductions ont aussi beaucoup été améliorées grâce à "
"l’incroyable travail de nos équipes de traducteurs."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1333238400.md:19
msgid ""
"We hope you will enjoy this release. Please give us feedback by sharing your"
" thoughts, blogging, tweeting, denting or by filing bug reports. With your "
"help, 4.10 will be the best release ever (at least until 4.12)!"
msgstr ""
"Nous espérons que vous apprécierez cette version. Merci de nous faire part "
"de vos retours en partageant vos impressions, en bloguant, en tweetant, en "
"publiant sur identi.ca ou en signalant des bugs. Avec votre aide, la 4.10 "
"sera la meilleure version jamais publiée (du moins jusqu’à la 4.12) !"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1333238400.md:21 content/about/news/1334361600.md:15
msgid ""
"Kind regards and thanks to everyone who has contributed to this release,<br "
"/>The Xfce development team"
msgstr ""
"Merci à tous ceux qui ont participé à cette version. Cordialement, <br "
"/>L’équipe de développement Xfce"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1333238400.md:23
msgid "[Download](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.10pre1/)"
msgstr "[Télécharger](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.10pre1/)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1333238400.md:24
msgid "[Changes in this release](/download/changelogs/4.10pre1)"
msgstr "[Nouveautés de cette version](/download/changelogs/4.10pre1)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1333238400.md:25
msgid "[Permalink](/about/news/1333238400/)"
msgstr "[Lien permanent](/about/news/1333238400/)"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/news/1334361600.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.10pre2 released"
msgstr "Sortie de Xfce 4.10pre2"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1334361600.md:7
msgid ""
"The Xfce development team is proud to announce the second preview release "
"for Xfce 4.10. Together with this preview release, the Xfce project "
"announces the string and code (only critical bug fixes or regressions) "
"freeze for the final 4.10 release which is set to be pushed out to the world"
" on April 28th, 2012."
msgstr ""
"L’équipe de développement est fière d’annoncer la seconde préversion de Xfce"
" 4.10. Désormais, seules les corrections de bogues critiques et de "
"régressions seront intégrées pour la sortie de la version finale de la 4.10 "
"prévue le 28 avril 2012."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1334361600.md:11
msgid ""
"This release incorporates some new features like improved responsiveness of "
"file operations in Thunar and tiling improvements in Xfwm4. Everything else "
"is bug fixes and a _lot_ of translation updates."
msgstr ""
"Cette version intègre de nouvelles fonctionnalités, telles que "
"l’amélioration de la réactivité des opérations sur les fichiers dans Thunar "
"et l’affichage en mosaïque dans Xfwm4. Tout le reste a été corrections de "
"bogues et mise à jour des traductions."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1334361600.md:13
msgid ""
"We hope you will enjoy this release. Please give us feedback by sharing your"
" thoughts, blogging, tweeting or by filing bug reports! With your help, 4.10"
" will be the best release ever (at least until 4.12)!"
msgstr ""
"Nous espérons que vous apprécierez cette version. Merci de nous faire part "
"de vos retours en partageant vos impressions, en bloguant, en tweetant ou en"
" signalant des bugs ! Avec votre aide, la 4.10 sera la meilleure version "
"jamais publiée (du moins jusqu’à la 4.12) !"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1334361600.md:17
msgid "[Download](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.10pre2/)"
msgstr "[Télécharger](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.10pre2/)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1334361600.md:18
msgid "[Changes in this release](/download/changelogs/4.10pre2)"
msgstr "[Nouveautés de cette version](/download/changelogs/4.10pre2)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1334361600.md:19
msgid "[Permalink](/about/news/1334361600/)"
msgstr "[Lien permanent](/about/news/1334361600/)"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.10 released"
msgstr "Sortie de Xfce 4.10"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:7
msgid ""
"Today, after 1 year and 4 months of work, we are pleased to announce the "
"release of the Xfce desktop 4.10, a new stable version that supersedes Xfce "
"4.8."
msgstr ""
"Aujourd’hui, après un an et quatre mois de travail, nous avons le plaisir de"
" vous annoncer la sortie du bureau Xfce 4.10, une nouvelle version stable "
"qui remplace la 4.8."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:11
msgid ""
"In the 4.10 cycle we mainly focused on polishing the desktop and improving "
"the user experience in various ways. Highlights of this release are:"
msgstr ""
"Durant le cycle 4.10, nous nous sommes principalement concentrés sur le "
"peaufinage du bureau et sur l’amélioration de l’expérience utilisateur de "
"diverses manières. Les points forts de cette version sont :"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:13
msgid ""
"A new application finder that has been completely rewritten and combines the"
" functionality of the old xfce4-appfinder and xfrun4."
msgstr ""
"Un nouveau chercheur d’application qui a entièrement été réécrit et combine "
"les fonctionnalités de l’ancien xfce4-appfinder et de xfrun4."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:14
msgid ""
"The panel now has an alternative vertical display mode (a deskbar). What is "
"more, panel plugins can be arranged in multiple rows, which is particularly "
"useful in the deskbar mode."
msgstr ""
"Le tableau de bord peut dorénavant être affiché verticalement (mode barre de"
" bureau). Qui plus est, ses greffons peuvent être disposés sur plusieurs "
"rangées, ce qui est particulièrement appréciable avec ce nouveau mode."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:15
msgid ""
"A new MIME type editor that allows you to easily change applications used "
"for opening different file types. The mouse and touchpad settings dialog and"
" the settings editor were extended in terms of functionality. The former now"
" supports tablets in a much better way."
msgstr ""
"Un nouvel éditeur de type MIME qui permet de facilement modifier les "
"applications utilisées pour ouvrir différents types de fichiers. La fenêtre "
"de paramétrage de la souris et du pavé tactile, ainsi que l’éditeur de "
"paramètres, ont vu leurs fonctionnalités améliorées. Celui-ci gère aussi "
"bien mieux les tablettes."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:16
msgid ""
"It is now possible to launch applications and open files on the desktop with"
" a single click of the mouse. In addition, the 4.10 desktop can display "
"thumbnails and automatically advance through the wallpaper list."
msgstr ""
"Il est désormais possible de lancer les applications et d’ouvrir les "
"fichiers sur le bureau avec un seul clic. De plus, le bureau 4.10 peut "
"afficher les miniatures et changer automatiquement de fond d’écran à partir "
"d’une liste."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:17
msgid ""
"The window manager can be configured to tile windows when dragging them to "
"the screen edges. The tab window (Alt+Tab) supports more flexible theming "
"and cursor key navigation."
msgstr ""
"Le gestionnaire de fenêtres peut être configuré pour les fenêtres en "
"mosaïque en les faisant glisser vers les bords de l’écran. La fenêtre de "
"l’onglet (Alt + Tab) prend en charge une thématisation plus souple et la "
"touche de navigation du curseur."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:19
msgid "An online tour of the changes in Xfce 4.10 can be viewed here:"
msgstr ""
"Une présentation en ligne des changements apportés dans Xfce 4.10 peut être "
"consultée ici :"

#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:21 content/about/news/1425081600.md:52
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:50
msgid "<https://xfce.org/about/tour>"
msgstr "<https://xfce.org/about/tour>"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:23
msgid ""
"A detailed overview of the changes compared to Xfce 4.8 and Xfce 4.10 "
"preview releases can be found on the following page:"
msgstr ""
"Un aperçu détaillé des changements par rapport à Xfce 4.8 et aux versions "
"preview de Xfce 4.10 peut être consulté sur la page suivante :"

#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:25 content/about/news/1425081600.md:56
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:54
msgid "<https://xfce.org/download/changelogs>"
msgstr "<https://xfce.org/download/changelogs>"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:27 content/about/news/1425081600.md:58
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:56 content/about/news/1608595200.md:44
#: content/about/news/1671062400.md:25 content/about/news/1734220800.md:25
msgid ""
"This release can be downloaded either as a set of individual packages or as "
"a single fat tarball including all these individual versions:"
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez télécharger individuellement les paquets de cette version ou "
"sous la forme d’un fichier d’archive les contenant tous."

#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:29
msgid "<http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.10>"
msgstr "<http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.10>"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1335571200.md:31
msgid ""
"Thank you all the contributors, bug reporters, as well as translators and "
"packagers for your efforts in making this release possible."
msgstr ""
"Merci à tous les contributeurs, rapporteurs de bogues, traducteurs et "
"empaqueteurs, grâce aux efforts desquels cette publication fut possible."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.12 released"
msgstr "Sortie de Xfce 4.12"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:7
msgid "Xfce 4.12 is be the best release ever (yes, we like to party!)!"
msgstr ""
"Xfce 4.12 sera la meilleure version jamais publiée (oui, nous aimons faire "
"la fête !)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:11
msgid "Source : Internet comments."
msgstr "Source : Commentaires Internet"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:13
msgid ""
"Today, after 2 years and 10 months of work, we are pleased to announce the "
"release of the Xfce desktop 4.12, a new stable version that supersedes Xfce "
"4.10."
msgstr ""
"Aujourd’hui, après deux ans et dix mois de travail, nous avons le plaisir "
"d’annoncer la sortie du bureau Xfce 4.12, une nouvelle version stable qui "
"remplace la 4.10."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:15
msgid ""
"This long period can only be explained by how awesome Xfce 4.10 was. But as "
"all things, it needed some refreshing - and for that we saw lots of new "
"contributors providing valuable feedback, features and bugfixes. As always, "
"Xfce follows its steady pace of evolution without revolution that seems to "
"match our users' needs."
msgstr ""
"Cette longue période ne peut s’expliquer que par le caractère formidable de "
"Xfce 4.10. Mais comme toute chose, il avait besoin d’un rafraîchissement, et"
" pour cela nous avons vu de nombreux nouveaux contributeurs apporter des "
"retours précieux, des fonctionnalités et des corrections de bugs. Comme "
"toujours, Xfce suit son rythme régulier d’évolution sans révolution, qui "
"semble correspondre aux besoins de nos utilisateurs."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:17
msgid ""
"In this 4.12 cycle, we mainly focused on polishing our user experience on "
"the desktop and window manager, and on updating some components to take "
"advantage of newly available technologies."
msgstr ""
"Avec la version 4.12, nous nous sommes principalement concentrés sur "
"l’amélioration de l’expérience utilisateur du bureau et du gestionnaire de "
"fenêtres, ainsi que sur la mise à jour de certains composants pour tirer "
"partie des nouvelles technologies disponibles."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:19
msgid "The main highlights of this release are:"
msgstr "Voici les principales nouveautés de cette version :"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:21
msgid ""
"The window manager gained a new themable Alt+Tab dialog with optional "
"windows preview and a list mode. Initial Client side decoration support was "
"implemented, window tiling mode was improved providing support for corner-"
"tiling, and a new zooming mode was added. A HiDPI Xfwm theme was also added."
msgstr ""
"Le gestionnaire de fenêtres dispose d’une nouvelle boîte de dialogue Alt+Tab"
" personnalisable avec une prévisualisation optionnelle des fenêtres et un "
"mode « Liste ». Une prise en charge initiale des décorations côté client a "
"été implémentée, le mode de disposition en mosaïque des fenêtres a été "
"amélioré via la prise en charge des mosaïques en coin d’écran, et un nouveau"
" mode zoom a été ajouté. Un thème Xfwm HiDPI a aussi été ajouté."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:22
msgid ""
"The panel can now intelligently hide itself, supports Gtk3 plugins, and saw "
"lots of its third-party plugins updated to take full advantage of the "
"features added in 4.10."
msgstr ""
"Le tableau de bord peut maintenant se masquer intelligemment, prend en "
"charge les greffons Gtk3, et a vu de nombreux greffons de tierces parties "
"mis à jour pour profiter des améliorations introduites dans Xfce 4.10."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:23
msgid ""
"The desktop has a new wallpaper settings dialog, per workspace wallpaper "
"support, and better multi-monitor handling. It also supports displaying "
"folder cover art and emblems on icons now."
msgstr ""
"Le bureau profite d’un nouveau gestionnaire de fond d’écran, réglable par "
"espace de travail, qui gère mieux les moniteurs multiples. Il prend "
"également en charge l’affichage sous forme d’images des dossiers et les "
"emblèmes sur les icônes."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:24
msgid ""
"Our session manager was updated to use logind and/or upower if available for"
" hibernate/suspend support. For portability and to respect our users' "
"choices, fallback modes were implemented relying on os-specific backends."
msgstr ""
"Notre gestionnaire de sessions a été mis à jour afin d’utiliser logind et / "
"ou upower si disponible pour la prise en charge de la mise en veille / mise "
"en veille prolongée. Pour des raisons de portabilité et pour respecter les "
"choix de nos utilisateurs, des modes de secours ont été implémentés en "
"s’appuyant sur des moteurs spécifiques aux systèmes d’exploitation."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:25
msgid ""
"Support for multi-monitor use was improved in a new display settings dialog "
"and a quick setup popup on monitor plugging."
msgstr ""
"La prise en charge du multi-écrans a été améliorée dans une nouvelle fenêtre"
" des paramètres d’affichage et un popup de configuration rapide lors de la "
"connexion d’un moniteur."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:26
msgid "The appearance dialog now showcases previews for icons and themes."
msgstr ""
"La fenêtre d’apparence affiche maintenant des prévisualisations pour les "
"icônes et les thèmes."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:27
msgid "Xfsettingsd now supports libinput."
msgstr "Xfsettingsd prend désormais en charge libinput."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:28
msgid ""
"Power management was not forgotten: A new panel plugin was created, "
"logind/upower support was added to handle battery/lid/brightness events, and"
" locking via light-locker was implemented. The settings dialog was also "
"revamped, and support for X11 screenblanking was added."
msgstr ""
"La gestion de l’alimentation n’a pas été oubliée : un nouveau greffon de "
"tableau de bord a été créé, la prise en charge de logind/upower a été "
"ajoutée pour gérer les événements de batterie, de couvercle et de "
"luminosité, et le verrouillage via light-locker a été implémenté. La boîte "
"de dialogue des paramètres a également été remaniée, et la prise en charge "
"de la mise en veille de l’écran X11 a été ajoutée."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:29
msgid ""
"Our file manager, the beloved Thunar, saw an insane amount of improvements: "
"tab support, tons of bug fixes, speed-ups, key shortcuts for custom actions,"
" better naming of file copies and links, nice freespace bar in properties, "
"tweaks for the renamer and other dialogs, improved keyboard navigation, "
"fixes for the treeview pane, better wallpaper support, Gtk3 bookmarks "
"support, multiple file properties... need we say more?"
msgstr ""
"Notre gestionnaire de fichiers, le bien-aimé Thunar, a vu un nombre "
"incroyable d’améliorations : la prise en charge des onglets, des tonnes de "
"corrections de bogues, des optimisations, des raccourcis clavier pour les "
"actions personnalisées, un meilleur nommage des copies de fichier et des "
"liens, une jolie barre d’espace libre dans les propriétés de dossier, des "
"ajustements pour l’outil de renommage et d’autres boîtes de dialogue, une "
"navigation au clavier améliorée, des corrections pour l’arborescence du "
"panneau latéral, une meilleure prise en charge du fond d’écran, la prise en "
"charge des signets Gtk3, les propriétés pour les fichiers multiples… avons-"
"nous besoin d’en dire plus ?"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:30
msgid ""
"To prepare the future of Xfce with Gtk3, which no longer requires theme "
"engines, we are stopping the development of our Gtk theme engine, and "
"dropping our Gtk3 engine - theme makers, please update your themes to CSS if"
" you want them to work on the next Xfce version."
msgstr ""
"Afin de préparer l’avenir de Xfce avec Gtk3, qui ne nécessite plus de "
"moteurs de thème, nous arrêtons le développement de notre moteur de thème "
"Gtk et abandonnons notre moteur Gtk3. Créateurs de thèmes, veuillez mettre à"
" jour vos thèmes en CSS si vous voulez qu’ils fonctionnent sur la prochaine "
"version de Xfce."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:31
msgid ""
"Due to gstreamer1.0 having dropped the mixer-interface entirely, and "
"xfce4-mixer and xfce4-volumed relying on this interface with gstreamer0.10, "
"our mixer application and volume daemon cannot be ported to 1.0 and are "
"consequently not maintained anymore."
msgstr ""
"En raison de l’abandon par gstreamer1.0 de l’interface du mélangeur audio, "
"et xfce4-mixer + xfce4-volumed s’appuyant sur cette interface avec "
"gstreamer0.10, notre application de mélange audio et notre démon de volume "
"ne peuvent pas être portés vers gstreamer1.0 et ne sont par conséquent plus "
"maintenus."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:33
msgid ""
"Xfce wouldn't be what it is right now without all its goodies. In this area,"
" we also saw a flurry of activity, most notably:"
msgstr ""
"Xfce ne serait pas ce qu’il est aujourd’hui sans tous ses goodies. Dans ce "
"domaine, nous avons également observé une effervescence d’activité, "
"notamment :"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:35
msgid "Xfburn gained BluRay Disc burning support."
msgstr "Xfburn prend désormais en charge la gravure des disques BluRay."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:36
msgid "Task manager UI was totally revamped, and got ported to Gtk3."
msgstr ""
"Le gestionnaire de tâches a été complètement remanié et a été porté vers "
"Gtk3."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:37
msgid ""
"Parole's UI was totally redone, parts of it rewritten with many features "
"added. Furthermore it was ported to Gtk3 and gstreamer1.0."
msgstr ""
"L’interface utilisateur de Parole a été complètement revue, en partie "
"réécrite avec de nombreux ajouts de fonctionnalités. En outre, Parole a été "
"porté vers Gtk3 et gstreamer1.0."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:38
msgid "Mousepad was totally rewritten and got an initial port to Gtk3."
msgstr ""
"Mousepad a été complètement réécrit et dispose d’un premier portage vers "
"Gtk3."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:39
msgid "Imgur.com support was added to the screenshooter."
msgstr ""
"La prise en charge d’imgur.com a été ajoutée au logiciel de capture d’écran."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:40
msgid "A new GNOME-Shell-like dashboard named xfdashboard is now available."
msgstr ""
"Un nouveau tableau de bord nommé xfdashboard, inspiré de celui de GNOME-"
"Shell, est maintenant disponible."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:41
msgid "A new alternative menu for the panel named whiskermenu was added."
msgstr ""
"Un nouveau menu alternatif pour le tableau de bord, nommé whisker, a été "
"ajouté."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:42
msgid "The GNOME2 hardware monitor plugin was ported to our panel."
msgstr ""
"Le greffon (plugin) de surveillance du matériel de GNOME2 a été porté vers "
"notre tableau de bord."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:43
msgid ""
"Weather plugin got a totally new user interface with powerful customization "
"options and provides tons of detailed information."
msgstr ""
"Le greffon météo dispose d’une interface utilisateur entièrement nouvelle "
"avec des options de personnalisation avancées et fournit des tonnes "
"d’informations détaillées."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:44
msgid ""
"Eyes plugin uses 3D coordinates to calculate its eye position, so even more "
"sometimes scary, sometimes funny eyes will spy on you!"
msgstr ""
"Le greffon (plugin) Eyes utilise des coordonnées 3D pour calculer la "
"position de ses yeux, ainsi des yeux tantôt effrayants, tantôt amusants, "
"vous espionneront encore plus !"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:45
msgid ""
"Netload plugin works with the new udev net interface names and can be "
"configured to show transfer rates in the panel."
msgstr ""
"Le greffon de charge réseau fonctionne avec les noms de la nouvelle "
"interface udev et peut être configuré pour afficher les taux de transfert "
"sur le tableau de bord."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:46
msgid "Clipboard manager plugin optionally displays a QR code."
msgstr ""
"Le greffon gestionnaire de presse-papiers affiche en option un code QR."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:47
msgid ""
"Cpufreq plugin now supports the intel pstate driver and can adapt better for"
" different panel sizes and information displayed."
msgstr ""
"Le greffon cpufreq prend maintenant en charge le pilote Intel pstate et "
"s’adapte mieux aux différentes tailles du tableau de bord et aux "
"informations affichées."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:48
msgid ""
"Nearly all plugins have been improved to give the same look and feel and to "
"support the new deskbar panel mode."
msgstr ""
"Presque tous les greffons ont été améliorés afin d’offrir la même ergonomie "
"et de prendre en charge le nouveau mode barre du bureau pour le tableau de "
"bord."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:50
msgid "An online tour of the changes in Xfce 4.12 can be viewed here:"
msgstr ""
"Une présentation en ligne des changements apportés dans Xfce 4.12 peut être "
"consultée ici :"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:54
msgid ""
"A detailed overview of the changes between Xfce 4.10 and Xfce 4.12 releases "
"can be found on the following page:"
msgstr ""
"Un aperçu détaillé des changements entre les versions Xfce 4.10 et Xfce 4.12"
" peut être consulté sur la page suivante :"

#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:60
msgid "<http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.12>"
msgstr "<http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.12>"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:62
msgid ""
"A warm thank you all the contributors, translators and packagers for your "
"efforts in making this release possible. We would also like to thank our "
"fantastic users and occasional contributors who submitted bug reports, "
"helped us find issues and sometimes provided patches. We are currently "
"reviewing all patches sent to us and will include many more fixes to Xfce in"
" the next release. We would also like to thank the many people who donated "
"money to our project via Bounty Source. This will help us meet and hack on "
"Xfce in the future!"
msgstr ""
"Un grand merci à tous les contributeurs, traducteurs et empaqueteurs d’avoir"
" rendu cette version possible. Nous aimerions aussi remercier nos "
"incroyables utilisateurs et contributeurs occasionnels de nous avoir aidés à"
" repérer des problèmes, soumis des rapports de bogues et parfois des "
"correctifs. Nous passons actuellement en revue tous les correctifs envoyés "
"et en inclurons de nombreux dans la prochaine version. Nous aimerions "
"également exprimer notre gratitude aux nombreux donateurs à travers Bounty "
"Source. Ceci nous aidera à rendre Xfce encore meilleur dans le futur !"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1425081600.md:64
msgid ""
"As always, we welcome everyone who would like to contribute to the "
"development of Xfce! You can either [test "
"Xfce](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/building) and [report "
"bugs](https://bugzilla.xfce.org), you can help us with "
"[translations](https://www.transifex.com/tag/xfce/) and "
"[documentation](https://docs.xfce.org), with [usability and user "
"experience](https://wiki.xfce.org/design/start) by packaging Xfce into your "
"distribution, and by [submitting "
"patches](https://wiki.xfce.org/dev/howto/contribute) or entirely new "
"features! You can get in touch with us on the Freenode IRC channel #xfce-dev"
" and our [mailing list](https://mail.xfce.org/mailman/listinfo/xfce4-dev)."
msgstr ""
"Comme toujours, nous accueillons tous ceux qui souhaitent contribuer au "
"développement de Xfce ! Vous pouvez soit [tester "
"Xfce](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/building) et [signaler des "
"bugs](https://bugzilla.xfce.org), soit nous aider avec les "
"[traductions](https://www.transifex.com/tag/xfce/) et la "
"[documentation](https://docs.xfce.org), avec l’[ergonomie et l’expérience "
"utilisateur](https://wiki.xfce.org/design/start) en intégrant Xfce dans "
"votre distribution, et en [soumettant des "
"correctifs](https://wiki.xfce.org/dev/howto/contribute) ou de toutes "
"nouvelles fonctionnalités ! Vous pouvez nous contacter sur le canal IRC "
"#xfce-dev de Freenode et sur notre [liste de "
"diffusion](https://mail.xfce.org/mailman/listinfo/xfce4-dev)."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.14 released"
msgstr "Sortie de Xfce 4.14"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:7
msgid ""
"Today, after 4 years and 5 months of work, we are pleased to announce the "
"release of the Xfce desktop 4.14, a new stable version that supersedes Xfce "
"4.12."
msgstr ""
"Aujourd’hui, après 4 ans et 5 mois de travail, nous avons le plaisir "
"d’annoncer la sortie du bureau Xfce 4.14, une nouvelle version stable qui "
"remplace la 4.12."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:11
msgid ""
"In this 4.14 cycle the main goal was to port all core components to Gtk3 "
"(over Gtk2) and GDBus (over D-Bus GLib). Most components also received "
"GObject Introspection support. Along the way we ended up polishing our user "
"experience, introducing quite a few new features and improvements (read "
"below) and fixings a boatload of bugs (read changelog)."
msgstr ""
"Dans ce cycle 4.14, l’objectif principal était de porter tous les composants"
" de base sur Gtk3 (sur Gtk2) et GDBus (sur D-Bus GLib). La plupart des "
"composants ont également reçu la prise en charge de GObject Introspection. "
"En cours de route, nous avons fini par peaufiner notre expérience "
"utilisateur, en introduisant pas mal de nouvelles fonctionnalités et "
"améliorations (lire ci-dessous) et en corrigeant une multitude de bogues "
"(lire le journal des modifications)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:13
msgid "The **main highlights of this release** are:"
msgstr "Les **principaux points forts de cette version** sont :"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:15
msgid ""
"The [window manager](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfwm4/start) received a slew"
" of updates and features, including support for VSync (using either Present "
"or OpenGL as backend) to reduce or remove display flickering, HiDPI support,"
" improved GLX support with NVIDIA proprietary/closed source drivers, support"
" for XInput2, various compositor improvements and a new default theme."
msgstr ""
"Le [gestionnaire de fenêtres](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfwm4/start) a reçu"
" une multitude de mises à jour et de fonctionnalités, notamment la prise en "
"charge de VSync (en utilisant soit Present, soit OpenGL comme backend) pour "
"réduire ou supprimer le scintillement de l’affichage, la prise en charge du "
"HiDPI, une prise en charge améliorée de GLX avec les pilotes propriétaires/à"
" code fermé de NVIDIA, la prise en charge de XInput2, diverses améliorations"
" du compositeur et un nouveau thème par défaut."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:16
msgid ""
"The [panel](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-panel/start) got support for "
"RandR's primary monitor feature, improved window grouping in the tasklist "
"plugin (better UX, visual group indicator etc), a per-panel \"icon-size\" "
"setting, a new default clock format and clock format evaluator as well as an"
" improved default panel layout."
msgstr ""
"Le [tableau de bord](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-panel/start) a reçu la"
" prise en charge de la fonctionnalité de moniteur principal de RandR, un "
"regroupement de fenêtres amélioré dans le greffon de liste des tâches "
"(meilleure expérience utilisateur, indicateur visuel de groupe, etc.), un "
"réglage « icon-size » par tableau de bord, un nouveau format d’horloge par "
"défaut et un évaluateur de format d’horloge, ainsi qu’une disposition par "
"défaut du tableau de bord améliorée."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:17
msgid ""
"The [desktop](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfdesktop/start) now has support "
"for RandR's primary monitor feature, an orientation option for icon "
"arrangement, a \"Next Background\" context menu option to advance the "
"wallpaper and it now syncs the user's wallpaper selection to "
"AccountsService."
msgstr ""
"Le [bureau](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfdesktop/start) prend désormais en "
"charge la fonctionnalité de moniteur principal de RandR, une option "
"d’orientation pour la disposition des icônes, une option de menu contextuel "
"« Arrière-plan suivant » pour changer de fond d’écran, et il synchronise "
"désormais la sélection de fond d’écran de l’utilisateur avec "
"AccountsService."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:18
msgid ""
"A completely new settings dialog to [manage color "
"profiles](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/color) has been created."
" For most users this means out of the box support for color-managed printing"
" (through cupsd) and scanning (through saned). For monitor profiles you will"
" have to install an additional service like xiccd."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:19
msgid ""
"The [display dialog](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/display) "
"received a lot of attention during this cycle and a big feature: Users are "
"now able to save and (automatically) restore complete multi-display "
"configurations, which is especially helpful for those who frequently connect"
" their laptop to varying docking stations or setups. Furthermore a lot of "
"time was spent on making the user interface more intuitive and a hidden "
"option was added to support RandR display scaling (configured via Xfconf)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:20
msgid ""
"We added an option to enable Gtk window scaling to the [appearance "
"dialog](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/appearance) and a "
"monospace font option as well. However we had to drop theme previews as they"
" didn't produce consistent results with Gtk3."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:21
msgid ""
"While we decided to drop splash screens from the [session "
"manager](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-session/start), we added lots of "
"features and fixes instead. Among them are hybrid sleep support, "
"improvements to the default session startup avoiding race conditions, a "
"feature to add and edit autostart entries, a switch user button in the "
"logout dialog and improved session chooser and settings dialogs (the latter "
"with a new tab that shows saved sessions). Furthermore you can now run "
"commands not only \"autostart style\" at login time, but also when your "
"computer suspends, logs out etc. Finally Gtk applications are now session-"
"managed over DBus and screensavers are also communicated with (e.g. "
"inhibited) over DBus."
msgstr ""
"Bien que nous ayons décidé de supprimer les écrans de démarrage du "
"[gestionnaire de session](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-session/start), "
"nous avons ajouté de nombreuses fonctionnalités et corrections à la place. "
"Parmi elles, la prise en charge de la veille hybride, des améliorations au "
"démarrage de la session par défaut évitant les conditions de concurrence, "
"une fonctionnalité pour ajouter et modifier des entrées de démarrage "
"automatique, un bouton de changement d’utilisateur dans la boîte de dialogue"
" de déconnexion et des boîtes de dialogue de sélection de session et de "
"paramètres améliorées (ces dernières avec un nouvel onglet qui affiche les "
"sessions enregistrées). De plus, vous pouvez désormais exécuter des "
"commandes non seulement « à la manière du démarrage automatique » à la "
"connexion, mais aussi lorsque votre ordinateur se met en veille, se "
"déconnecte, etc. Enfin, les applications Gtk sont désormais gérées par la "
"session via DBus, et les économiseurs d’écran communiquent également (par "
"exemple pour être inhibés) via DBus."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:22
msgid ""
"As always, [Thunar](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/start) - our file "
"manager - received a lot of features and fixes. Among the visible changes "
"are the completely reworked pathbar, support for larger thumbnails as well "
"as support for a \"folder.jpg\" file altering the folder's icon (e.g. for "
"music album covers). Power users will also notice the improved keyboard "
"navigation (zooming, tab navigation). Thunar's volume manager has gained "
"Bluray support."
msgstr ""
"Comme toujours, [Thunar](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/start) — notre "
"gestionnaire de fichiers — a reçu de nombreuses fonctionnalités et "
"corrections. Parmi les changements visibles figure la barre de chemin "
"entièrement retravaillée, la prise en charge de vignettes plus grandes ainsi"
" que la prise en charge d’un fichier « folder.jpg » modifiant l’icône du "
"dossier (par exemple pour les pochettes d’albums de musique). Les "
"utilisateurs avancés remarqueront également la navigation au clavier "
"améliorée (zoom, navigation par tabulation). Le gestionnaire de volumes de "
"Thunar prend désormais en charge le Bluray."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:23
msgid ""
"Our [thumbnailing service "
"tumbler](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/tumbler) received a lot of fixes "
"and support for the Fujifilm RAF format."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:24
msgid ""
"The [application finder](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-appfinder/start) "
"can now optionally be opened as a single window and can now be more easily "
"navigated with the keyboard only."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:25
msgid ""
"The [power manager](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-power-manager/start) "
"received a lot of bugfixes and some smaller features, including support for "
"the XF86Battery button and for the newly created xfce4-screensaver. The "
"panel plugin also saw several improvements: it can now optionally show the "
"remaining time and/or percentage and it now relies on UPower's standard icon"
" names to work with more icon themes out of the box. With LXDE moving on to "
"a QT base the LXDE panel plugin was dropped."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:27
msgid ""
"A lot of **applications and plugins** that are part of the Xfce eco-system -"
" often dubbed \"goodies\" - are part of what makes Xfce great. A lot of "
"those have also seen important changes along the timeline of the 4.14 "
"release. To highlight a few:"
msgstr ""
"De nombreuses **applications et greffons (plugins)** qui font partie de "
"l’écosystème Xfce — souvent appelés « goodies » — font partie de ce qui fait"
" la qualité de Xfce. Beaucoup d’entre eux ont également connu des "
"changements importants au fil de la version 4.14. Pour en citer quelques-"
"uns :"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:29
msgid ""
"Our [notification service](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/notifyd/start) has "
"gained support for persistence - in other words: notification logging - and "
"a \"Do Not Disturb\" mode, which suppresses all notifications. A new panel "
"plugin was created that shows missed notifications (especially helpful "
"during \"Do Not Disturb\" mode) and gives quick access to toggling \"Do Not "
"Disturb\" mode. Finally support for showing notifications on RandR's primary"
" monitor was added."
msgstr ""
"Notre [service de notification](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/notifyd/start) "
"prend désormais en charge la persistance — en d’autres termes : la "
"journalisation des notifications — et un mode « Ne pas déranger », qui "
"supprime toutes les notifications. Un nouveau greffon de tableau de bord a "
"été créé, qui affiche les notifications manquées (particulièrement utile "
"pendant le mode « Ne pas déranger ») et donne un accès rapide à "
"l’activation/désactivation du mode « Ne pas déranger ». Enfin, la prise en "
"charge de l’affichage des notifications sur le moniteur principal de RandR a"
" été ajoutée."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:30
msgid ""
"Our media player [Parole](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/parole/start) received "
"improved support for network streams and podcasts, as well as a new \"mini "
"mode\" and automatic choosing of the best available video backend. "
"Furthermore it also inhibits both screensavers and power managers during "
"video playback now, making sure users don't have to go wiggle their mouse "
"periodically while enjoying a movie."
msgstr ""
"Notre lecteur multimédia [Parole](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/parole/start) a"
" reçu une meilleure prise en charge des flux réseau et des podcasts, ainsi "
"qu’un nouveau « mini mode » et la sélection automatique du meilleur backend "
"vidéo disponible. De plus, il inhibe désormais à la fois les économiseurs "
"d’écran et les gestionnaires d’alimentation pendant la lecture vidéo, ce qui"
" évite aux utilisateurs de devoir agiter périodiquement leur souris pendant "
"qu’ils regardent un film."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:31
msgid ""
"Our image viewer [Ristretto](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/ristretto/start) has"
" seen various user interface improvements and support for setting the "
"desktop wallpaper. It has recently also seen its first Gtk3-based "
"development release."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:32
msgid ""
"The [screenshooter](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/screenshooter/start) now "
"allows users to move the selection rectangle and at the same time displays "
"its width and height. The imgur upload dialog was revamped and the command "
"line allows for more flexibility."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:33
msgid ""
"Our [clipboard manager](https://docs.xfce.org/panel-plugins/clipman/start) "
"now has improved keyboard shortcut support (through a port to "
"GtkApplication), improved and more consistent icon sizing as well as a new "
"application icon."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:34
msgid ""
"The [pulseaudio panel plugin](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/pulseaudio-"
"plugin/start) received MPRIS2 support to be able to remotely control media "
"players and desktop-wide multimedia key support, essentially rendering "
"xfce4-volumed-pulse a superfluous additional daemon."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:35
msgid ""
"And finally the [terminal "
"emulator](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/terminal/start) saw a huge amount of "
"bug fixes and improvements since Xfce 4.12."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:37
msgid ""
"There is also a group of **new projects** that have become part of our "
"project. Say hi to:"
msgstr ""
"Il y a aussi un groupe de **nouveaux projets** qui ont rejoint notre projet."
" Dites bonjour à :"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:39
msgid ""
"We finally have our own "
"[screensaver](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/screensaver/start) (yes - we "
"realize it's 2019 ;)). With lots of features and tight Xfce integration "
"(obviously) it is a great addition to our catalog."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:40
msgid ""
"The [status notifier panel plugin](https://goodies.xfce.org/projects/panel-"
"plugins/xfce4-statusnotifier-plugin) provides a next-generation system tray "
"where applications can show indicators. It supersedes the Ubuntu-centric "
"xfce4-indicator-plugin for most application indicators."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:41
msgid ""
"[Catfish file search](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/catfish/start) is like an "
"old friend for most Xfce users - now it's officially part of Xfce!"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:42
msgid ""
"Finally [Panel Profiles](https://git.xfce.org/apps/xfce4-panel-"
"profiles/about/), which allows you to backup and restore your panel layouts,"
" has moved under the Xfce umbrella."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:44
msgid ""
"As always it’s also time to say goodbye to some older **unmaintained or "
"deprecated projects**. (Luckily our projects only go to the attic aka the "
"archive on git.xfce.org when they die.) With a salty teardrop of sadness we "
"bid farewell to:"
msgstr ""
"Comme toujours, il est également temps de dire au revoir à certains projets "
"plus anciens, **non maintenus ou dépréciés**. (Heureusement, nos projets ne "
"vont au grenier — c’est-à-dire aux archives sur git.xfce.org — que "
"lorsqu’ils meurent.) Avec une larme salée de tristesse, nous disons adieu "
"à :"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:46
msgid ""
"garcon-vala, gtk-xfce-engine, pyxfce, thunar-actions-plugin, xfbib, xfc, "
"xfce4-kbdleds-plugin, xfce4-mm, xfce4-taskbar-plugin, xfce4-windowlist-"
"plugin, xfce4-wmdock-plugin and xfswitch-plugin"
msgstr ""
"garcon-vala, gtk-xfce-engine, pyxfce, thunar-actions-plugin, xfbib, xfc, "
"xfce4-kbdleds-plugin, xfce4-mm, xfce4-taskbar-plugin, xfce4-windowlist-"
"plugin, xfce4-wmdock-plugin et xfswitch-plugin"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:48
msgid "An online tour of the changes in Xfce 4.14 can be viewed here:"
msgstr ""
"Une présentation en ligne des changements de Xfce 4.14 peut être visionnée "
"ici :"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:52
msgid ""
"A detailed overview of the changes between Xfce 4.12 and Xfce 4.14 releases "
"can be found on the following page:"
msgstr ""
"Une vue d’ensemble détaillée des changements entre Xfce 4.12 et Xfce 4.14 "
"peut être trouvée sur la page suivante :"

#: content/about/news/1565568000.md:58
msgid "<http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.14>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.16 released"
msgstr "Sortie de Xfce 4.16"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:7
msgid ""
"Today, after 1 year and 4 months of work, we are happy to announce the "
"release of the Xfce desktop 4.16, a new stable version that supersedes Xfce "
"4.14."
msgstr ""
"Aujourd’hui, après un an et quatre mois de travail, nous avons le plaisir de"
" vous annoncer la sortie du bureau Xfce 4.16, une nouvelle version stable "
"qui remplace la 4.14."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:11
msgid ""
"4.16 was a special cycle in many respects (not only pandemic-wise, but "
"also). One of the corner-stones of the non-code changes concerns our "
"migration to GitLab, which is a change in development workflow and a huge "
"step forward in terms of becoming more contributor-friendly and welcoming. "
"In parts, the [humungous changelog of Xfce "
"4.16](https://www.xfce.org/download/changelogs/4.16) can be attributed to "
"new contributors proposing merge requests (288 merge requests were merged or"
" closed against our core components alone!). We also created a reference "
"Docker container ([xfce/xfce-build](https://hub.docker.com/r/xfce/xfce-"
"build)) and added CI pipelines to all components to ensure we don´t break "
"the build. None of this would have been possible without our hosting being "
"sponsored by [Gandi](https://gandi.net) and "
"[Fosshost](https://fosshost.org)!"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:13
msgid ""
"Another big change concerns our visual identity, which we updated from a "
"strange mix of random (partly Tango-based) icons and not following any "
"naming scheme to a new, visually consistent set (following the "
"freedesktop.org naming specification and a fixed color palette). We´re aware"
" this will generate some work for icon theme maintainers (if they really "
"want to override our gorgeous icons ;)) but we believe the longterm benefit "
"outweighs this one-time effort."
msgstr ""
"Un autre grand changement concerne notre identité visuelle, que nous avons "
"mise à jour à partir d’un étrange mélange d’icônes aléatoires (en partie "
"basées sur Tango) et ne suivant aucun schéma de dénomination vers un nouvel "
"ensemble visuellement cohérent (suivant la spécification de dénomination de "
"freedesktop.org et une palette de couleurs fixe. ). Nous sommes conscients "
"que cela générera du travail pour les responsables de thèmes d’icônes (s’ils"
" veulent vraiment remplacer nos magnifiques icônes ;)) mais nous pensons que"
" l’avantage à long terme l’emporte sur cet effort ponctuel."

#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:15
msgid ""
"<img src=\"//cdn.xfce.org/about/tour/4.16/upstream-icons.png\" border=\"0\" "
"alt=\"upstream-icons\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/>\n"
msgstr ""
"<img src=\"//cdn.xfce.org/about/tour/4.16/upstream-icons.png\" border=\"0\" "
"alt=\"upstream-icons\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:17
msgid ""
"And then finally we did some housekeeping (e.g. by dropping Gtk2 support "
"code) and we also added features and improvements - all while sticking to a "
"reasonable release cycle timeframe."
msgstr ""
"Et puis finalement, nous avons fait un peu de ménage (par exemple en "
"abandonnant le code Gtk2) et nous avons également ajouté des fonctionnalités"
" et des améliorations - tout en respectant un délai de cycle de publication "
"raisonnable."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:19
msgid ""
"So without further ado, here go the **main highlights of this release**:"
msgstr ""
"Donc, sans plus attendre, voici les **principaux points forts de cette "
"version** :"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:21
msgid ""
"The [window manager](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfwm4/start) received lots "
"of updates and improvements again in the area of compositing and GLX. If a "
"primary display was set, the alt-tab dialog will now only be shown there. "
"Furthermore some handy new options to zoom the cursor along with rest of the"
" display as well as an option to keep minimized windows in the most recently"
" used list complement this release."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:22
msgid ""
"We added a new plugin to the "
"[panel](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-panel/start) dubbed “statustray” "
"which combines both StatusNotifier and legacy Systray items. An animated "
"autohide transition now clearly shows the user “where the panel has gone” "
"and a dark mode (enabled by default) makes the panel drop into the "
"background a bit more with bright themes like the Gtk default Adwaita. Quite"
" a few more smaller improvements were also introduced like accessing desktop"
" actions from a Launcher´s right-click menu, the Window Buttons plugin now "
"offering to `Launch a new instance` of an application and the Workspace "
"Switcher now optionally showing automatic numbering for workspaces."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:23
msgid ""
"Support for fractional scaling was added to the [display "
"dialog](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/display), along with "
"highlighting the preferred mode of a display with an asterisk and adding "
"aspect ratios next to resolutions. Falling back to a working mode after "
"misconfiguring the display layout has also been made more robust."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:24
msgid ""
"A new tab in the “About Xfce” dialog shows basic system information like CPU"
" or GPU type. Furthermore the layout and visuals of the dialog were "
"improved."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:25
msgid ""
"The [settings manager](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/start) has "
"improved search and filter capabilities. Furthermore all settings dialogs "
"now use window decorations drawn by Gtk (client side decorations)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:26
msgid ""
"The “Mime Settings” and “Preferred Applications” dialogs were merged into "
"the “Default Applications” dialog - making it easier for users to set which "
"application handles which filetype or action from one place."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:27
msgid ""
"Our file manager [Thunar](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/start) received "
"a boatload of fixes and quite a few notable features, including pause for "
"copy/move operations, support for queued file transfer, remembering view "
"settings per directory and support for transparency in Gtk themes."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:28
msgid ""
"Our [thumbnailing service "
"tumbler](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/tumbler) became more flexible by "
"being able to exclude paths. Furthermore support for .epub (e-book format) "
"was added."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:29
msgid ""
"The [session manager](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-session/start) offers"
" improved support for GPG agent 2.1 and the setting dialog was visually "
"improved."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:30
msgid ""
"The [power manager](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-power-manager/start) "
"received a lot of bugfixes and some smaller features - among them a cleanup "
"of its settings dialog, an optional visual indicator for when `Presentation "
"Mode` is enabled, more accurate battery status icons and automatically "
"dismissing low-power notifications upon the connection of a charger."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:31
msgid ""
"The [desktop](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfdesktop/start) mostly received "
"bugfixes and small improvements - and the new default wallpaper!"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:32
msgid ""
"Our menu library [garcon](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/garcon/start) received "
"new APIs and now doesn´t launch applications as children of the process "
"hosting the menu anymore. The previous behavior led to applications crashing"
" along with e.g. the panel."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:33
msgid ""
"The [applicaton finder](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-appfinder/start) "
"now allows for sorting applications by “frecency” - a combination of "
"frequency and recency."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:34
msgid ""
"Dependency updates: Drop Gtk2, add LibGTop, bump Gtk &gt;= 3.22, GLib and "
"GDBus &gt;= 2.50"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:36
msgid "An online tour of the changes in Xfce 4.16 can be viewed here:"
msgstr ""
"Une présentation en ligne des changements de Xfce 4.16 peut être visionnée "
"ici :"

#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:38
msgid "<https://www.xfce.org/about/tour416>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:40
msgid ""
"A detailed overview of the changes between Xfce 4.14 and Xfce 4.16 releases "
"can be found on the following page:"
msgstr ""
"Une vue d’ensemble détaillée des changements entre Xfce 4.14 et Xfce 4.16 "
"peut être trouvée sur la page suivante :"

#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:42
msgid "<https://www.xfce.org/download/changelogs/4.16>"
msgstr ""

#: content/about/news/1608595200.md:46
msgid "<https://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.16>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/news/1671062400.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.18 released"
msgstr "Sortie de Xfce 4.18"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1671062400.md:7
msgid ""
"After almost two years of work, we are happy to announce the release of Xfce"
" 4.18 !"
msgstr ""
"Après presque deux ans de travail, nous sommes heureux de vous annoncer la "
"sortie de Xfce 4.18 !"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1671062400.md:11
msgid ""
"Since Xfce 4.16 a lot of major development happened. Our team added multiple"
" nice new features, did a gazillion of bug fixes and did various minor "
"improvements. Finally, all that is going to be released for your pleasure."
msgstr ""
"Depuis Xfce 4.16, de nombreux développements majeurs se sont produits. Notre"
" équipe a ajouté plusieurs nouvelles fonctionnalités intéressantes, effectué"
" un million de corrections de bogues et apporté diverses améliorations "
"mineures. Enfin, tout cela va être libéré pour votre plaisir."

#: content/about/news/1671062400.md:13
msgid ""
"<img src=\"//cdn.xfce.org/about/screenshots/4.18-1.png\" border=\"0\" "
"alt=\"Xfce 4.18 screenshot\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/>\n"
msgstr ""
"<img src=\"//cdn.xfce.org/about/screenshots/4.18-1.png\" border=\"0\" "
"alt=\"Capture d’écran de Xfce 4.18\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1671062400.md:15
msgid ""
"This development cycle was influenced a lot by [GSoC "
"2021](https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com/archive/2021/organizations/5706869816950784)"
" and [GSoC "
"2022](https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com/programs/2022/organizations/xfce),"
" which led to various new features, most of them for Thunar, the Xfce File "
"Manager. Though as well multiple other Xfce components got a lot of love and"
" many improvements were done under the hood."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1671062400.md:17
msgid ""
"Assuming you have installed Xfce 4.16, here is an overview on the major "
"changes you will see on an upgrade to Xfce 4.18:"
msgstr ""
"En supposant que vous avez installé Xfce 4.16, voici un aperçu des "
"principaux changements que vous verrez lors d’une mise à niveau vers Xfce "
"4.18 :"

#: content/about/news/1671062400.md:19
msgid "<https://www.xfce.org/about/tour418>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1671062400.md:21
msgid ""
"A detailed overview of the changes between Xfce 4.16 and Xfce 4.18 releases "
"can be found on the following page:"
msgstr ""
"Un aperçu détaillé des changements entre les versions Xfce 4.16 et Xfce 4.18"
" est disponible sur la page suivante :"

#: content/about/news/1671062400.md:23
msgid "<https://www.xfce.org/download/changelogs/4.18>"
msgstr ""

#: content/about/news/1671062400.md:27
msgid "<https://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.18>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.20 released"
msgstr "Sortie de Xfce 4.20"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:7
msgid ""
"After almost two years of work, we are happy to announce the release of Xfce"
" 4.20 !"
msgstr ""
"Après presque deux ans de travail, nous sommes heureux de vous annoncer la "
"sortie de Xfce 4.20 !"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:11
msgid ""
"Since Xfce 4.18 a lot of major development happened. Our team added many "
"nice new features, did a gazillion of bug fixes and did various minor "
"improvements. Finally, all that was released for your pleasure."
msgstr ""
"Depuis Xfce 4.18, de nombreux développements majeurs se sont produits. Notre"
" équipe a ajouté plusieurs nouvelles fonctionnalités intéressantes, effectué"
" un million de corrections de bogues et apporté diverses améliorations "
"mineures. Enfin, tout cela va être libéré pour votre plaisir."

#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:13
msgid ""
"<img src=\"//cdn.xfce.org/about/screenshots/4.20-1.png\" border=\"0\" "
"alt=\"Xfce 4.20 screenshot\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/>\n"
msgstr ""
"<img src=\"//cdn.xfce.org/about/screenshots/4.20-1.png\" border=\"0\" "
"alt=\"Capture d’écran de Xfce 4.20\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:15
msgid ""
"The major focus during this development cycle was the preparation of the "
"codebase to be ready for Wayland. So that we meanwhile have experimental "
"Wayland support for most components. More details in the links below."
msgstr ""
"L’objectif principal de ce cycle de développement a été de préparer la base "
"de code pour qu’elle soit prête pour Wayland. Ainsi, nous disposons entre-"
"temps d’un support expérimental de Wayland pour la plupart des composants. "
"Plus de détails dans les liens ci-dessous."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:17
msgid ""
"Assuming you have installed Xfce 4.18, here is an overview on the major "
"changes you will see on an upgrade to Xfce 4.20:"
msgstr ""
"En supposant que vous avez installé Xfce 4.18, voici un aperçu des "
"principaux changements que vous verrez lors d’une mise à niveau vers Xfce "
"4.20 :"

#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:19
msgid "<https://www.xfce.org/about/tour420>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:21
msgid ""
"A detailed overview of the changes between Xfce 4.18 and Xfce 4.20 releases "
"can be found on the following page:"
msgstr ""
"Un aperçu détaillé des changements entre les versions Xfce 4.18 et Xfce 4.20"
" est disponible sur la page suivante :"

#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:23
